### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signup
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "user4@test.com",
  "password": "2115",
  "name": "aan",
  "surname": "aowalski"
}

### Sign in as existing user
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/signin
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "user3@test.com",
  "password": "2115"
}

